{"script":"wt_c3_10_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"x":410,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":410,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]居然从那里全身而退了……真了不起，你们总是能创造一些不可思议的奇迹。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]我收到过关于黑涧浴池的很多报告。比起其他危险区域，那里最可怕的一点，是曾有失神者的存在。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]失去神智的人居然和魔物一起四处破坏，我还是第一次看见这种情况。或许在异变面前，智慧生物和普通魔物也没有任何区别吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]嗯，这些顾虑还是放在日后慢慢思考吧。来，这是你们的报酬，非常感谢你们帮助大家打退了魔物～[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":410,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"紧急契约：黑涧浴池"}